  "cmd_name": "set-adb-secure",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Sets the ADB authentication status of an instance. If ADB authentication is enabled, the cloud phone instance verifies the validity of the ADB key pair when you connect to the instance over ADB. In this case, bind an ADB key pair before connecting to the cloud phone instance over ADB. If ADB authentication is disabled, the cloud phone instance does not verify the validity of the ADB key pair. You can connect to the cloud phone instance over ADB as long as network connectivity is available",
  "description_zh": "设置实例的ADB鉴权状态。\n\n如果设置ADB鉴权状态为开启，通过ADB去连接云手机实例时，云手机实例会校验ADB密钥对的合法性；此时建议您绑定ADB密钥对后，再通过ADB连接云手机实例。\n\n如果设置ADB鉴权状态为关闭，通过ADB去连接云手机实例时，云手机实例不会校验ADB密钥对的合法性，即只要网络是通的，就能通过ADB连接上云手机实例",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun eds-aic set-adb-secure --status 1 --region cn-hangzhou",
